# Example environment variables for the backend
#
# CLEARBIT_API_KEY - optional API key for Clearbit autocomplete service.
#                     If not present the public endpoint will still respond
#                     but you may encounter stricter rate limits.
#
# MISTRAL_URL, MISTRAL_MODEL, MISTRAL_API_KEY - used by ResumeImprover
#
# Example:
# CLEARBIT_API_KEY=pk_test_XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
